---
const stats = [
  { value: "50+", label: "Clients served" },
  { value: "100+", label: "Cases Won" },
]
---

<section id="about-us" class="bg-muted py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- Image -->
    <div class="reveal relative">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
        <img
          src="/images/lawyer-with-client.png"
          alt="Two Seven Business consultants reviewing performance charts together"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 hidden rounded-2xl bg-accent px-8 py-6 text-white shadow-lg sm:block">
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-800 leading-none">{stats[0].value}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest text-white/80">{stats[0].label}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
      <p class="mb-3 font-heading text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">
        Who We Are
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl">
        A partner invested in your success
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 h-1 w-14 rounded bg-accent"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        At Ilomo Attorneys, we take great pride in our strong client relationships, which are deeply rooted in
        the provision of exceptional legal services. We are based in Njombe Town within Tanzania, committed to
        providing legal services to individuals, businesses and organizations.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        With our team of experienced lawyers, we offers a full range of legal services to meet your diverse needs. Whether
        you require assistance with litigation, family related legal matters or real estate matters, we have the
        expertise to provide effective legal solutions.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-4">
        {
          stats.map((s) => (
            <div>
              <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-foreground">{s.value}</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs propercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">{s.label}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
